      },
      {
        tag: "unit",
        id: "Haldric_II",
        type: "Haldric II",
        side: 2,
        x: 17,
        y: 22,
        name: _("Haldric II"),
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "carryover_3",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "set_variable",
            name: "carryover_percentage",
            value: 40,
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_4",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:play_music",
            file: "the_king_is_dead.ogg",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            text: _("And thus, in the eyes of the dwarven sages, Rugnur died a glorious death — and with him, Thursagan, greatest of the Runesmiths, whose legacy was soon lost. But our tale is not yet complete. For Alanin lived still, as did Krawg the Gryphon."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_5",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            text: _("Alanin traveled south to Wesnoth, to report the events of the past years to Haldric II."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_6",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            text: _("And Krawg — well, Krawg followed him. I know not how. But Krawg made his way south, to Weldyn, and reached it about the time that Alanin did."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "loyal_7",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:make_loyal",
            units: "Haldric_II",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "clock_8",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "set_variable",
            name: "turn_limit",
            value: 1,
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "objectives",
        side: 1,
        victory: _(""),
        defeat: _(""),
        children: [
          {
            tag: "defeat",
            condition: "hook",
            hook: "predicate:turn_limit",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_1",
        on: "prestart",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "Guard_Captain",
            type: "Royal Guard",
            side: 2,
            x: 15,
            y: 16,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "Guard_Captain",
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "u_1",
            type: "Royal Guard",
            side: 2,
            x: 17,
            y: 16,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "u_1",
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
