            type: "Royal Guard",
            side: 2,
            x: 20,
            y: 24,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "u_5",
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "u_6",
            type: "Royal Guard",
            side: 2,
            x: 17,
            y: 25,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "u_6",
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "u_7",
            type: "Royal Guard",
            side: 2,
            x: 12,
            y: 24,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "u_7",
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "u_8",
            type: "Royal Guard",
            side: 2,
            x: 11,
            y: 22,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "u_8",
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "u_9",
            type: "Royal Guard",
            side: 2,
            x: 11,
            y: 19,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "u_9",
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "u_10",
            type: "Royal Guard",
            side: 2,
            x: 12,
            y: 18,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "u_10",
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "Gatekeeper",
            type: "Swordsman",
            side: 2,
            x: 15,
            y: 5,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "Gatekeeper",
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "u_11",
            type: "Swordsman",
            side: 2,
            x: 17,
            y: 6,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "u_11",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:unstore_unit",
            variable: "alanin",
            x: 18,
            y: 1,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:config_recruit",
            side: 1,
            mode: "disallow",
            types: "",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_2",
        on: "start",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            unit: "Alanin",
            x: 16,
            y: 5,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gatekeeper",
            text: _("Halt! What is your business in Weldyn, capital of Wesnoth?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Alanin",
            text: _("Stand aside. I am Alanin, of Haldric’s royal guard, and I bring news from the Northlands."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gatekeeper",
            text: _("Very well. You may pass."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            unit: "Alanin",
            x: 16,
            y: 14,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Guard Captain",
            text: _("I hear you desire to speak to the King, Alanin. What do you have to tell him?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Alanin",
            text: _("I bring tidings of the Sceptre of Fire, commissioned fifteen years ago by our king. I have been away for a long time, do not delay me even more."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Guard Captain",
            text: _("Enter, Alanin, and give the King your message."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            unit: "Alanin",
            x: 16,
            y: 19,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:store_unit",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            kill: "yes",
            id: "Alanin",
          },
          {
            tag: "foreach",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            item: "this_item",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
                variable: "this_item.profile",
                value: "portraits/alanin-epilogue.webp",
                mode: "value",
              },
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:unstore_unit",
                variable: "this_item",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Alanin",
            text: _("My King, you had sent me on a mission into the Northlands with the Ruby of Fire. I have returned."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Haldric II",
            text: _("Of course, I could not forget. Was the Sceptre completed?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Alanin",
            text: _("I believe it was completed, my lord, but I do not have it. I’m afraid it is buried deep in the mountains of the Northlands."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Haldric II",
            text: _("What!? Why? Do the dwarves not honor our contract? Has Rugnur, or whatever his name is, become a thief?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Alanin",
            text: _("My Lord, the dwarves led by Rugnur are dead, slain by fire and smoke as lava poured out of one of the mountains. I saw the eruption from afar as I was returning to you."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Haldric II",
            text: _("Why were you returning without the Sceptre, then?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Alanin",
            text: _("We had been besieged by elves, in a dwarvish castle that was not Rugnur’s. Rugnur sent me back, with the message that the Sceptre was near completion, but he and all the rest of the dwarves went into the caves south of the Arkan-thoria, and were immediately followed by hundreds of elves."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Haldric II",
            text: _("If the Sceptre was not completed in your sight, what makes you so sure it exists?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Alanin",
            text: _("I will let Krawg explain that."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Haldric II",
            text: _("Who?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "set_variable",
            name: "krawg.x",
            value: 19,
          },
          {
            tag: "set_variable",
            name: "krawg.y",
            value: 21,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:unstore_unit",
            variable: "krawg",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gatekeeper",
            text: _("My lord, a gryphon has just flown over our walls! It may be a sign of an attack!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Alanin",
            text: _("No, that is my... friend Krawg. He went with Rugnur into the caves, but escaped through a hole in the roof right before the lava filled the cave."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Krawg",
            text: _("Kraw! Lost!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Haldric II",
            text: _("What the devil! I’m supposed to believe this?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Alanin",
            text: _("It’s difficult to accept, you are right, my liege. However, I have fought side-by-side with the dwarves and this gryphon, and I stake my honor on the story. What’s more, the gryphon has some evidence. Show him, Krawg."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Krawg",
            text: _("Krah! Here!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            text: _("Krawg reached over his back with his beak and brought out a scorched parchment, which he dropped at the feet of the king."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Alanin",
            text: _("Those are the plans for the Sceptre, or at least an earlier version."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Haldric II",
            text: _("I see. Well... what do you want me to do now? The Sceptre of Fire is made, yes, but I don’t know where it is, the makers are dead..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Alanin",
            text: _("I do not know. I only bring the news, I did not cause it, nor do I fully understand its implications. But, my advice would be to do nothing. I believe you will not find it, though you send a hundred armies to look for it. But record in the history books that the Sceptre of Fire does exist."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Haldric II",
            text: _("Your advice is grating to my ears, not what I wish to hear... and yet, I see the wisdom in it, and I agree. Alanin, you’ve served in the army long enough to retire, and even if you hadn’t, you’ve seen enough combat. Go back to your village, and I shall see that you and your family live well and enjoy great success."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Alanin",
            text: _("Thank you, my lord."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:play_music",
            file: "traveling_minstrels.ogg",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "wesnoth-icon.png",
            text: _("The Sceptre would not be found until many generations after Haldric II, in the time of Asheviere the Dark Queen. During that time, it remained in the caves of the Northlands, occasionally moved around by orcs who never understood its true power."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "wesnoth-icon.png",
            text: _("But before it was found, legends grew up around it, and around its makers — Thursagan, most brilliant of the Dwarven Sages, and Rugnur, the greatest of the Dwarven Heroes of old."),
          },
          {
            tag: "win",
          },
        ],
      },
    ],
  },
]
